<title>HONG KONG: Wing On Co 1996 net rises 22.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing On Co 1996 net rises 22.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   96.7     vs 78.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    45.0     vs 40.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    286.38   vs 232.99</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,787.50 vs 2,626.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing On Company International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 16-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 7</p>
<p>NOTE - Wing On Company is a department store, property holding and hotel services company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 69 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 24 cents) vs 58 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
